<section class="section black-800"><div class="section-gap"><div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container w-container"><div class="about-row about-who"><div class="about-left about-who"><div class="section-header left"><div class="section-badge"><div class="pill-dot"></div><div class="badge-text">WHO WE ARE</div></div><div class="about-who-intro"><h2 class="section-heading">A consulting partner for teams building what’s next.</h2><p class="paragraph-regular about-who">AXIOMET works at the intersection of technology, engineering, and business strategy.</p></div></div><div data-to-top="0" class="about-who-bottom"><div class="about-who-text"><p class="paragraph-regular case-work">From early-stage startups to established technology teams, we help organizations navigate difficult decisions, solve technical challenges, and turn ambitious ideas into systems that work in the real world.</p><p class="paragraph-regular case-work">We don’t believe in one-size-fits-all solutions. Every engagement starts with understanding the problem, the business, the technology, and what success actually looks like.</p></div><a data-wf--primary-button--variant="bg-white" data-wf-component-id="4c762986-7cae-1c12-bec9-1ecbb760ee61" data-wf-variant-state="21f200ea-2927-6f93-7fe0-867acd69adf4" href="/service" class="primary-button w-variant-21f200ea-2927-6f93-7fe0-867acd69adf4 w-inline-block"><div class="button-text-pill"><div class="button-text is-one">Explore Service</div><div class="button-text is-two">Explore Service</div></div><div class="button-arrow-pill"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" class="button-arrow"><path d="M15.8333 12.5002H9.99992H3.33325L3.33325 5.8335V5.3335" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M12.5 16.6668L16.6667 12.5002L12.5 8.3335" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><svg xmlns="http://www.