<section class="section team"><div class="section-gap about-team"><div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container w-container"><div class="section-header _w-w-work v2"><div class="section-badge"><div class="pill-dot"></div><div class="badge-text">THE PEOPLE BEHIND AXIOMET</div></div><div class="max-width-28"><h2 class="section-heading">Built by people who think in systems.</h2></div></div><div data-delay="4000" data-animation="slide" class="how-w-work-slider about-team w-slider" data-autoplay="false" data-to-top="0" data-easing="ease" data-hide-arrows="false" data-disable-swipe="false" data-autoplay-limit="0" data-nav-spacing="3" data-duration="500" data-infinite="true"><div class="h-w-work-slider-mask about-team w-slider-mask"><div class="h-w-work-slide w-slide"><div class="about-team-card"><div class="about-team-info"><div class="about-team-name">Alex Morgan</div><div class="font-small">Founder &amp; Technology Strategist</div></div><img src="/images/6ac7431353246a9b8fc951c5_Frame%202147227775.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="/images/6ac7431353246a9b8fc951c5_Frame%202147227775-p-500.webp 500w, /images/6ac7431353246a9b8fc951c5_Frame%202147227775-p-800.webp 800w, /images/6ac7431353246a9b8fc951c5_Frame%202147227775.webp 1320w" alt="Alex Morgan, Founder &amp; Technology Strategist at Axiomet" class="about-team-image"/></div></div><div class="h-w-work-slide w-slide"><div class="about-team-card"><div class="about-team-info"><div class="about-team-name">Maya Chen</div><div class="font-small">Principal Systems Engineer</div></div><img src="/images/6ac74334a211cadd39f7ecc0_Frame%202147227778.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="/images/6ac74334a211cadd39f7ecc0_Frame%202147227778-p-500.webp 500w, /images/6ac74334a211cadd39f7ecc0_Frame%202147227778-p-800.webp 800w, /images/6ac74334a211cadd39f7ecc0_Frame%202147227778-p-1080.webp 1080w, /images/6ac74334a211cadd39f7ecc0_Frame%202147227778.webp 1320w" alt="Maya Chen, Principal Systems Engineer at Axiomet" class="ab